{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_title", "source_sha256": "a87661ae78f1557e95448468ca0504a65e453d795ee2aee694723dbc08c900fa", "ja": "響と舞台裏", "zh": "响与后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f3fbe94a1a8a25461f5bb2ec400ab35fadb89a9112e44ef018c9065aed0de6c7", "ja": "響との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "这是与响在后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1000_null", "source_sha256": "eb0394840ced16cdd31c851daf22e26d9c6425f71d03b28da1edb506f082dcde", "ja": "―ツアー直前　合同レッスン日―", "zh": "——巡演前夕　联合练习日——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "7ea5b49c654c12eeefe28bbf7c78c619ec1dc04121e16c4f375a48dd61f8dea9", "ja": "プロデューサー！　この後のグループの\nダンスレッスンだけど、自分も入ってもいい？", "zh": "制作人！关于接下来的团体舞蹈练习，我也可以参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1002_402cpr", "source_sha256": "39168e106fd3bb10cf8891359add809e1d9af5f15016b5e141c035aa753da3c8", "ja": "え？　スケジュールは大丈夫だけど……。\nこの後ダンサー組じゃなかったか？", "zh": "诶？日程倒是没问题……  \n不过接下来不是舞者组吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "22857396abf5094d84d413ba56cc68124c8afc672fb278ff0376d131488acfc2", "ja": "うん！　自分、ダンサー組のダンスも\nカンペキに覚えてるから、心配いらないぞ。", "zh": "嗯！我连舞者组的舞蹈也都记得一清二楚，所以不用担心啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1004_402cpr", "source_sha256": "be9b622f7e7bd52ff4051b9dea70adfb7a0342939333dd4f0300e84bf2d8dae5", "ja": "……さすがだな。\n響がいいなら問題ないけど、急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "……真不愧是你。\n只要响觉得没问题就成，不过怎么突然这么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "1364a0a57419dc3d86183ccc813968159820f2ea74157198333d56f66b8a98a0", "ja": "ふふーん、自分も先輩になったからねっ。\n後輩たちのお手本になろうかなと思って。", "zh": "哼哼——因为我也成前辈了嘛。\n所以想着要给后辈们做个榜样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "f51a66665be3d9a651bf42e828b8e53a34a60292b40265df2b9195ce302f89dd", "ja": "それに、みんなすごいんだぞ！　杏奈はすっごく大人し\nそうなのに、ダンスではめちゃくちゃ目立つし！", "zh": "而且，大家都很厉害啊！杏奈明明看起来特别安静，跳起舞来却非常抢眼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1007_402cpr", "source_sha256": "63c986ea5010d099b97ded14b14a3d9bb9b3705a40814be4728f7e4b6cd20c3c", "ja": "ああ、あの子……。\nなるほど、響にもわかるみたいだな。", "zh": "啊，那孩子……  \n原来如此，连响也看得出来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "efb53079de5173c5c1028c6ac827d9758fb16b23383a850f1f75fd467f187ca4", "ja": "当然さー。でも、メリハリをつけたほうがもっと\nよくなりそうだから、直接いいたくて。いいでしょ？", "zh": "那是当然啦。不过，再注意一下张弛有度的话感觉会\n更好，所以我想直接跟她说。可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1009_402cpr", "source_sha256": "3975b50ea27b0e974f67d6e3c160a28da087b42bb636a9a3d802d8bab7977686", "ja": "もちろん。てっきり、また自分を追い込む\nつもりなのかと思ったよ。", "zh": "当然可以。我还以为你又打算\n把自己逼得太紧了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "1f2d04f7201b9de9125aa8386cd6b7369dd26323e5db44bb6691bdfe16155c71", "ja": "本番前に、そんな無茶するわけないぞ？\n自分、もう先輩だしっ。", "zh": "正式演出前，我才不会做那么乱来的事吧？\n我已经是前辈了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1011_402cpr", "source_sha256": "c16e9c3764dd30d8b46caa2a578cbe018082ee79b5c047ac1f9cddc481ff1e4d", "ja": "おっと、そうだな。\n当てにしてるぞ、先輩！", "zh": "哦，对啊。就指望你了，前辈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_013hib_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "71cedf45959e7f2a02c546766e79e1abf0d050f6db8524afa39c7479a4fa6994", "ja": "任せてよ！　あ、プロデューサーも先輩になったみたい\nだから、ちゃんとするんだぞ？　あっははは！", "zh": "交给我吧！啊，制作人好像也成前辈了，所以也要好好表现哦？啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
